body:
On my machine, when a little deep in a repo (not at the root), directly passing the root is faster by ~10ms.

Since it has already been computed in the `jj root` above, it could be passed in the command below:

```rust
let out = context.exec_cmd("jj", &["root", "--ignore-working-copy"])?.stdout;
let root = out.lines().next()?;

// and then
&["-R", &root, "log", ...]
```

